No I did not mean that (and am not sure that is what I DID say).  I think I
meant to say that we need to prescribe somewhat more than the narrow
definition of language if we are to have a controlled test bed sufficiently
well-defined that we can detect a Sapir-Whorf effect and identify it
convincingly as such.

